    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make fleshy</i> or <i>strong</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				603b30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.54e
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>grow fleshy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεσαρκωμένος</span>
			<i>fleshy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				656b10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make</i> or <i>produce flesh, flesh up a wound</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάτριψις σαρκοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Off.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾶσσον σαρκοῦται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>make flesh of</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκὸν ς</span>.,
			of a sculptor, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.742
			</span></i> ([<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>]).</div>
